  U sync flywheel ON/OFF (saved; menu FLYWHEEL; default ON),
  I IQ snapshot, o menu open/close, n/x menu next/select, c next channel, b next band, s scan,
  v video standard AUTO/NTSC/PAL, e close menu (web menu direct controls),
  F calibrate (startup steps again; video stops), L bench IQ lane comparison (video stops ~3 s),
  H bench: LUT writes while running (readback; another kp level for ~1 ms),
  N bench: noise floor with the video output on vs off (VTX off; video stops ~0.3 s x4),
  O LP policy: RESCUE by C/N benefit (default) <-> GAIN (G70/G65, earlier rule) (saved),
  Z DAC self-test (bench: test pattern, then one flat level per pin for a multimeter),
  ` reboot to USB download (flashing)
